 where `geo_line` did not support `sort_order`, silently ignoring the `DESC` option.\r\n\r\nThe [documentation](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-aggregations-metrics-geo-line.html) for `geo_line` claims that the option `sort_order` can be either `ASC` (default) or `DESC`:\r\n\r\n>This option accepts one of two values: \"ASC\", \"DESC\".\r\n>The line is sorted in ascending order by the sort key when set to \"ASC\", and in descending with \"DESC\".\r\n\r\nHowever, when testing this, no matter which you choose the actual order of points in the result is always `ASC` by the value of the `sort` field.\r\n\r\nFixes #94733\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/94734/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/94734/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":8866850007,"node_id":"CE_lADOAAe_f85huLINzwAAAAIQgWTX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/events/8866850007","actor":{"login":"craigtaverner","id":114451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDQ1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigtaverner","html_url":"https://github.com/craigtaverner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigtaverner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigtaverner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigtaverner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigtaverner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigtaverner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigtaverner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craigtaverner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cra